+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YPU6w75xYs2mptCAhLLArN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# T10: E-Commerce Backend\n2\t\n3\t**Category:** greenfield/complex\n4\t**Timeout:** 45 minutes\n5\t**Tests:** 48 unit (6 per service) + 22 integration = 70 total\n6\t\n7\t## Overview\n8\t\n9\tBuild an event-driven e-commerce backend with 8 independent services communicating through a read-only event bus. Each service implements a specific interface defined in `src/types.ts` and communicates with other services exclusively through events on the shared `EventBus` from `src/bus.ts`.\n10\t\n11\t## What to Build\n12\t\n13\tImplement 8 services, each in its own directory under `src/`:\n14\t\n15\t### src/catalog/index.ts - Product Catalog\n16\t- CRUD operations for products (create, get, list, search, update, remove)\n17\t- Emits `product:created` events\n18\t- Export: `createCatalogService(bus: EventBus): CatalogService`\n19\t\n20\t### src/inventory/index.ts - Inventory Management\n21\t- Stock tracking with set, get, reserve, release operations\n22\t- Low stock alert system with configurable thresholds\n23\t- Emits `inventory:updated` and `inventory:low_stock` events\n24\t- Export: `createInventoryService(bus: EventBus): InventoryService`\n25\t\n26\t### src/cart/index.ts - Shopping Cart\n27\t- Cart creation, item add/remove/update, clear operations\n28\t- Emits `cart:updated` events on any cart modification\n29\t- Export: `createCartService(bus: EventBus): CartService`\n30\t\n31\t### src/pricing/index.ts - Price Calculation\n32\t- Calculate totals with 10% tax rate\n33\t- Discount code support (percentage-based)\n34\t- Listens for `product:created` to track prices\n35\t- Export: `createPricingService(bus: EventBus): PricingService`\n36\t\n37\t### src/orders/index.ts - Order Management\n38\t- Order creation with PENDING initial status\n39\t- Status state machine: PENDING -> CONFIRMED -> SHIPPED -> DELIVERED (or CANCELLED)\n40\t- Emits `order:created` and `order:status_changed` events\n41\t- Export: `createOrderService(bus: EventBus): OrderService`\n42\t\n43\t### src/payment/index.ts - Payment Processing\n44\t- Async payment processing with configurable success/failure/timeout simulation\n45\t- Refund support for successful transactions\n46\t- Emits `payment:processed` events\n47\t- Export: `createPaymentService(bus: EventBus, options?: PaymentServiceOptions): PaymentService`\n48\t\n49\t### src/notifications/index.ts - Notification System\n50\t- User subscription model\n51\t- Listens for `order:status_changed` and `payment:processed` events\n52\t- Collects notifications per subscribed user\n53\t- Emits `notification:sent` events\n54\t- Export: `createNotificationService(bus: EventBus): NotificationService`\n55\t\n56\t### src/analytics/index.ts - Analytics Tracking\n57\t- Event counting by type\n58\t- Revenue tracking from successful payments\n59\t- Conversion rate calculation (orders / unique carts)\n60\t- Top products ranking by order quantity\n61\t- Listens for all major event types\n62\t- Export: `createAnalyticsService(bus: EventBus): AnalyticsService`\n63\t\n64\t## Constraints\n65\t\n66\t- **DO NOT modify** `src/bus.ts` or `src/types.ts` (checksums are validated)\n67\t- Each service must take `(bus: EventBus)` as its constructor parameter (payment also accepts options)\n68\t- Services must NOT import from each other's directories\n69\t- Services communicate ONLY through the event bus\n70\t- Each service function is a factory that returns the service interface\n71\t\n72\t## Validation\n73\t\n74\t```bash\n75\tnpm test        # All 70 tests must pass\n76\tnpm run build   # TypeScript must compile\n77\tnpm run lint    # No lint errors\n78\t```\n79\t\n80\t## Event Flow\n81\t\n82\t```\n83\tcatalog --[product:created]--> pricing (tracks prices)\n84\tinventory --[inventory:updated]--> (bus log)\n85\tinventory --[inventory:low_stock]--> (bus log)\n86\tcart --[cart:updated]--> (bus log)\n87\torders --[order:created]--> notifications (maps userId), analytics (tracks)\n88\torders --[order:status_changed]--> notifications (sends notif)\n89\tpayment --[payment:processed]--> notifications (sends notif), analytics (tracks revenue)\n90\tanalytics --[analytics:event]--> (bus log)\n91\tnotifications --[notification:sent]--> (bus log)\n92\t```\n93\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dbb6b37d-2a84-4949-9ce2-a01658ac5c71","uuid":"ee5b1800-70d6-46fb-ac52-702c82dfa277","timestamp":"2026-06-30T23:58:53.094Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/TASK.md","content":"# T10: E-Commerce Backend\n\n**Category:** greenfield/complex\n**Timeout:** 45 minutes\n**Tests:** 48 unit (6 per service) + 22 integration = 70 total\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild an event-driven e-commerce backend with 8 independent services communicating through a read-only event bus. Each service implements a specific interface defined in `src/types.ts` and communicates with other services exclusively through events on the shared `EventBus` from `src/bus.ts`.\n\n## What to Build\n\nImplement 8 services, each in its own directory under `src/`:\n\n### src/catalog/index.ts - Product Catalog\n- CRUD operations for products (create, get, list, search, update, remove)\n- Emits `product:created` events\n- Export: `createCatalogService(bus: EventBus): CatalogService`\n\n### src/inventory/index.ts - Inventory Management\n- Stock tracking with set, get, reserve, release operations\n- Low stock alert system with configurable thresholds\n- Emits `inventory:updated` and `inventory:low_stock` events\n- Export: `createInventoryService(bus: EventBus): InventoryService`\n\n### src/cart/index.ts - Shopping Cart\n- Cart creation, item add/remove/update, clear operations\n- Emits `cart:updated` events on any cart modification\n- Export: `createCartService(bus: EventBus): CartService`\n\n### src/pricing/index.ts - Price Calculation\n- Calculate totals with 10% tax rate\n- Discount code support (percentage-based)\n- Listens for `product:created` to track prices\n- Export: `createPricingService(bus: EventBus): PricingService`\n\n### src/orders/index.ts - Order Management\n- Order creation with PENDING initial status\n- Status state machine: PENDING -> CONFIRMED -> SHIPPED -> DELIVERED (or CANCELLED)\n- Emits `order:created` and `order:status_changed` events\n- Export: `createOrderService(bus: EventBus): OrderService`\n\n### src/payment/index.ts - Payment Processing\n- Async payment processing with configurable success/failure/timeout simulation\n- Refund support for successful transactions\n- Emits `payment:processed` events\n- Export: `createPaymentService(bus: EventBus, options?: PaymentServiceOptions): PaymentService`\n\n### src/notifications/index.ts - Notification System\n- User subscription model\n- Listens for `order:status_changed` and `payment:processed` events\n- Collects notifications per subscribed user\n- Emits `notification:sent` events\n- Export: `createNotificationService(bus: EventBus): NotificationService`\n\n### src/analytics/index.ts - Analytics Tracking\n- Event counting by type\n- Revenue tracking from successful payments\n- Conversion rate calculation (orders / unique carts)\n- Top products ranking by order quantity\n- Listens for all major event types\n- Export: `createAnalyticsService(bus: EventBus): AnalyticsService`\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **DO NOT modify** `src/bus.ts` or `src/types.ts` (checksums are validated)\n- Each service must take `(bus: EventBus)` as its constructor parameter (payment also accepts options)\n- Services must NOT import from each other's directories\n- Services communicate ONLY through the event bus\n- Each service function is a factory that returns the service interface\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\nnpm test        # All 70 tests must pass\nnpm run build   # TypeScript must compile\nnpm run lint    # No lint errors\n```\n\n## Event Flow\n\n```\ncatalog --[product:created]--> pricing (tracks prices)\ninventory --[inventory:updated]--> (bus log)\ninventory --[inventory:low_stock]--> (bus log)\ncart --[cart:updated]--> (bus log)\norders --[order:created]--> notifications (maps userId), analytics (tracks)\norders --[order:status_changed]--> notifications (sends notif)\npayment --[payment:processed]--> notifications (sends notif), analytics (tracks revenue)\nanalytics --[analytics:event]--> (bus log)\nnotifications --[notification:sent]--> (bus log)\n```\n","numLines":93,"startLine":1,"totalLines":93}}}
